6753.stem:
A project requires completion of 11 tasks A, B, C, . . . , K.

A network diagram for the project giving the completion time for each task, in minutes, is shown.

\exfigure{827_q37_1}

solutions.latex:
\exfigure{827_q37_s1}

Float time is latest start minus earliest start:
$$\begin{aligned} \text{Float} &= 18-17 \\ &= 1 \text{ minute} \end{aligned}$$

